      "title": "LIN Q3 Earnings Call Highlights Restructuring and Growth Outlook",
      "summary": "Linde (LIN) reported Q3 2026 adjusted EPS of $4.59 (up 9% YoY) and revenues of $9.4B (up 9% YoY), beating consensus estimates. The company initiated a $425M restructuring charge targeting cost efficiency with full run-rate savings expected in H2 2027. Despite strong electronics growth (15%) and a $7.9B project backlog, management maintained a cautious near-term outlook citing uneven industrial demand, particularly weakness in Europe and China's domestic consumption. Lincare homecare operations remain a profitability headwind.",
      "url": "https://www.zacks.com/stock/news/3019656/lin-q3-earnings-call-highlights-restructuring-and-growth-outlook?cid=CS-ZC-FT-analyst_blog_plus|earnings_call_takeaways-3019656",
